  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c132a027b2e3a7b4da49eb5048403053, type: 2}
    text: You just have 24 hours to spend with him!!!!
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDuration: 1.25
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c132a027b2e3a7b4da49eb5048403053, type: 2}
    text: I'm gonna take you away after that...
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDuration: 1.25
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6cb4028ff2cc77e478bbb362e91e66cd, type: 2}
    text: 'You''re the reason we cant''t be together all day...

'
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDuration: 1.25
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6cb4028ff2cc77e478bbb362e91e66cd, type: 2}
    text: I won't regret beating you.
    autoProgress: 1
    autoProgressDuration: 1.25
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c132a027b2e3a7b4da49eb5048403053, type: 2}
    text: 'I run faster than you ever can...

'
